          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx272np7vgyo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Mark Carney called the new US tariffs on Canada a \"miscalculation\" designed to \"hurt and divide us\".",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx272np7vgyo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Mark Carney announced Canada would match US tariffs \"dollar-for-dollar\" starting 8 September.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx272np7vgyo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Canada's retaliatory tariffs starting September 8 will include levies on steel, dairy, appliances, and electronics.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx272np7vgyo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The US imposed new 50% tariffs on a range of Canadian goods after trade talks broke down.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx272np7vgyo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The new 50% US tariffs cover about $20bn of Canadian imports, representing roughly 5% of total Canadian exports to the US.",
