          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx272np7vgyo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The newly targeted Canadian goods under US tariffs include wine, dairy, cement, clothing, and hockey equipment.",
