          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US President Donald Trump announced the latest tariffs to offset what he claimed was Canadian discrimination against American cars, dairy products, and alcohol.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/trumps-50-canada-tariffs-kick-in-whisky-alcohol-dairy-motorcycles-and-more-affected-check-list-11787416459825.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Canadian whisky brands potentially affected by the new US duties include Crown Royal, Canadian Club, and Black Velvet.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/trumps-50-canada-tariffs-kick-in-whisky-alcohol-dairy-motorcycles-and-more-affected-check-list-11787416459825.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Several Canadian provinces removed US-made alcoholic drinks from store shelves last year after Trump introduced an initial round of tariffs.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/trumps-50-canada-tariffs-kick-in-whisky-alcohol-dairy-motorcycles-and-more-affected-check-list-11787416459825.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
